        android:pathData="M 432,220 C 435,212 442,212 445,218 C 448,212 455,212 458,218 C 461,212 468,212 471,218 L 471,230 C 466,226 460,229 458,233 C 455,228 449,226 445,230 C 442,226 436,226 432,230 Z"
